DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Tue 17 Nov): 18 highs vs 420 lows (WSJ), the most lows and fewest highs in our chart (since 6 Oct), worse than 39 vs 341 Monday, as the S&P fell 1.03% for a fourth straight loss to its lowest close since July. Lows have beaten highs on every session in our chart this month except 4 Nov; more highs than lows again would be the first sign of healing. Watch whether Nvidia's beat lifts breadth on Wednesday."};

